      "created_at": "2014-03-31T16:52:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A question came up the other day when we had Mr Fixer in a fight against Plague Rat. Does Hoist Chain reduce Plague Rat's ability to do irreducible damage or does that not work because making someone do less damage counts as reducing their damage?<br><br>Or to put it in other words, is irreducible damage only irreducible at the point of impact, acting like armor piercing, or is it also irreducible at the source?</p>",
