      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Flintlock\"]\n\nSee I was confused, because in my mind, applying a debuff to Plague Rat (the source of the irreducable damage) registers in my mind as &quot;preventing&quot; it from ever occurring, but I see your collective points.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI had a similar reaction to Mega Computer; I was blown away by the idea that Fixer can use Riveting Crane on the villain and then all the Environment targets will hit the villain for full, even though they could be as much as -3 against the heroes.\n",
