      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-02T17:19:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There are pros and cons to redirection vs. prevention. &nbsp;Redirection can be redirected right back (thanks, Iron Legacy. :( ) but it also provides a better outcome for the heroes (reduce damage to heroes, increase damage to villains, profit!). &nbsp;But I see how it is derailing this thread as it is about damage reduction vs. irreducible vs. prevention, and redirection does not help the discussion at all. &nbsp;Sorry for my seguay.</p>",
